10. Questions that must be answered before implementation
1. weekKey format: Confirm Monday startOfWeek as yyyy-MM-dd string (recommended) vs adding a WeekPlan UUID (migration-heavy — not recommended now).
* Okay yes use yyyy-mm-dd these will always be unique and no need for uuid anyways
1. Week complete storage: Field on WeekPlan, derived from WeeklyReflection, or both?
* Field on week plan , reflections are not required technically if user just wants to plan.
1. Which complete paths open reflection? Detail Complete only, or also row swipe / status toggle?
* Any action that completes a task must open the reflection
1. sessionRPE: Reflection only, workout completedIntensityRPE only, or write-through both?
* Session RPE is its own field, to reflect the intensity of the given session. This shall not collide or be overlapped with strength training lift pre
1. Resolved for week close: Treat .partiallyCompleted and .imported as closed? Soft-deleted excluded (yes)?
* The distinction between done and not done is the status on the activity. Was it marked done? 
1. Cardinality: One ActivityReflection per workout (recommended) or many?
* One per workout
1. Scale definitions: Exact enums/ranges for feel, weekRating, fatigue, painLevel, bodyArea, side, timing, trends.
* Rate the week: 1–10 (The quality of the week as a whole.)
* Fatigue 1–5
    * Very fresh, Fresh, Normal, Fatigued, Very fatigued
* Recovery 1–5:
* Poor, Below average, Normal, Good, Excellent
* Sleep Quality 1-5
* Motivation to Train 1-5 : very low to very high
* Mood 1-5
* Life Stress 1-5
1. Re-complete after unlock: Replace reflection, edit in place, or leave first reflection?
* If activity is done and then reopened and the marked done again, offer user to overwrite existing reflection if one exists, else keep the existing one attached to the activity
1. Empty week Complete Week: Allow weekly reflection with no workouts?
* Yes, since reflection not required, this is fine. User can still reflect on why the week was empty
1. History / export: Show reflections in History and Week Summary export in v1?
* Yes absolutely to both. Reflections are tied to activities and weeks and should be exported fully.